{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NEH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"尼希米記","commonName":"尼希米記","title":"尼希米記","order":16,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"5a451750d43fbbe9672a724e76887607313488376fd06b55d2853d8e3e39ca47","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NEH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NEH/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["尼希米關心耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["哈迦利亞的兒子尼希米的言語如下： 亞達薛西王二十年基斯流月，我在書珊城的宮中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，有我一個弟兄哈拿尼，同着幾個人從猶大來。我問他們那些被擄歸回、剩下逃脫的猶大人和耶路撒冷的光景。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他們對我說：「那些被擄歸回剩下的人在猶大省遭大難，受凌辱；並且耶路撒冷的城牆拆毀，城門被火焚燒。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我聽見這話，就坐下哭泣，悲哀幾日，在天上的上帝面前禁食祈禱，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「耶和華－天上的上帝，大而可畏的上帝啊，你向愛你、守你誡命的人守約施慈愛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["願你睜眼看，側耳聽，你僕人晝夜在你面前為你眾僕人以色列民的祈禱，承認我們以色列人向你所犯的罪；我與我父家都有罪了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我們向你所行的甚是邪惡，沒有遵守你藉着僕人摩西所吩咐的誡命、律例、典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["求你記念所吩咐你僕人摩西的話，說：『你們若犯罪，我就把你們分散在萬民中；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但你們若歸向我，謹守遵行我的誡命，你們被趕散的人雖在天涯，我也必從那裏將他們招聚回來，帶到我所選擇立為我名的居所。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["這都是你的僕人、你的百姓，就是你用大力和大能的手所救贖的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["主啊，求你側耳聽你僕人的祈禱，和喜愛敬畏你名眾僕人的祈禱，使你僕人現今亨通，在王面前蒙恩。」",{"text":"我是作王酒政的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NEH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NEH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZR/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}